                <pb facs="0398" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg286"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.51/251</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-24T12:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 24, 1917, noon.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President Menocal has vetoed bill granting authority to make issue
                    30,000,000-dollar loan. Cause of veto certain restrictive provisions, one
                    requiring advertisements for bids and also elimination by Congress of certain
                    taxes including stamp tax proposed by President for interest and
                    amortization.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
